      notes: "PURPOSE: Show the Rs 30,550 illustrative annual value of the Senior Citizen Account.\n\nFACILITATION GUIDANCE:\n- Biggest lines: higher cash transaction limits (Rs 6,000), lounge access (Rs 3,000), free first-year locker (Rs 3,000) and additional FD interest (Rs 2,500).\n- Explain that each figure assumes a usage pattern, shown in brackets.\n\nCOMMON MISCONCEPTIONS:\n- The total is an illustration based on assumed usage, not a guaranteed saving."
